WEBVTT


00:02:57.140 --> 00:02:58.473
Your turn.


00:03:54.526 --> 00:03:55.643
Marc.


00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:59.192
Marc!


00:03:59.365 --> 00:04:00.652
Stop, damn it!


00:04:00.992 --> 00:04:01.732
Marc!


00:04:02.951 --> 00:04:04.865
Marc, you'll get us all killed!


00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:06.694
Marc!


00:04:08.206 --> 00:04:09.117
Marc!


00:04:35.232 --> 00:04:37.144
We finally made it!


00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.006
Next.


00:05:10.848 --> 00:05:11.964
Next.


00:05:29.574 --> 00:05:30.862
That's it?


00:05:31.535 --> 00:05:32.866
That's all there is.


00:05:34.287 --> 00:05:35.699
Unbelievable.


00:05:39.542 --> 00:05:40.782
Where are you going?


00:05:43.128 --> 00:05:44.666
Vila Olimpica.


00:05:47.549 --> 00:05:49.758
- And you?
- Verdaguer.


00:05:50.219 --> 00:05:51.584
To find my girlfriend.


00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:57.506
That's a GPS, right?


00:05:59.685 --> 00:06:01.018
Excuse rne?


00:06:01.437 --> 00:06:02.803
What's in your bag.


00:06:03.814 --> 00:06:05.682
It's the GPS that got stolen
downstairs.


00:06:07.193 --> 00:06:09.983
- Shut up and we'll talk.
- Okay.


00:06:11.571 --> 00:06:12.437
Listen.


00:06:14.449 --> 00:06:15.691
Look at him.


00:06:22.039 --> 00:06:23.280
The Terminator.


00:06:24.875 --> 00:06:26.494
Son of a bitch.


00:06:27.169 --> 00:06:30.415
He came from the future
to fuck us all up the ass.


00:06:38.679 --> 00:06:39.967
Marc Delgado.


00:06:50.024 --> 00:06:51.984
I'm sure you know why I'm here.


00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.727
Yes, we all do.


00:06:54.862 --> 00:06:56.353
What do they call me?


00:06:56.613 --> 00:06:58.197
The butcher?


00:07:00.784 --> 00:07:02.322
Or something worse?


00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:07.907
Marc Delgado.


00:07:09.208 --> 00:07:11.623
I see you're in charge
of the security protocol.


00:07:12.921 --> 00:07:15.335
The project leader
says you're behind schedule.


00:07:16.382 --> 00:07:18.500
Well, we've been having
some problems with...


00:07:18.676 --> 00:07:21.592
I'm not a programmer,
spare me the details.


00:07:21.762 --> 00:07:25.589
All I know is without the protocol
we can't test the project.


00:07:25.766 --> 00:07:28.100
If you were...
a programmer, I mean...


00:07:28.268 --> 00:07:30.637
you'd know it's a complicated
process.


00:07:30.896 --> 00:07:34.391
If we rush it the firewall will have
more holes than Swiss cheese.


00:07:34.607 --> 00:07:36.816
And we'll spend years
patching it up.


00:07:38.653 --> 00:07:40.236
Haste makes waste.


00:07:41.906 --> 00:07:43.193
Look, Delgado.


00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:47.739
If I'm here, it's because
someone's not doing his job.


00:07:48.411 --> 00:07:49.974
When things go well,
they don't call me.


00:07:50.164 --> 00:07:51.279
So listen carefully.


00:07:53.959 --> 00:07:56.919
If you get fired,
it's not going to be my fault.


00:08:03.008 --> 00:08:05.924
- It should be ready this month.
- Should be... or will be?


00:08:08.388 --> 00:08:09.596
Will be.


00:08:41.336 --> 00:08:42.202
Fuck!


00:08:50.094 --> 00:08:51.005
Hi.


00:08:51.679 --> 00:08:54.424
<i>Hi, sweetie.
We 're about to close.</i>


00:08:54.599 --> 00:08:57.969
<i>- How's it going?
- I 'm gonna be here a while.</i>


00:08:58.352 --> 00:09:00.437
Go get a drink with Andrea.


00:09:00.771 --> 00:09:02.389
No, I'll see you at home.


00:09:02.564 --> 00:09:05.810
Andrea always keeps me out
all night.


00:09:05.985 --> 00:09:07.271
You guys are a bore!


00:09:07.486 --> 00:09:09.023
You're worse than my parents.


00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:14.278
<i>See you at home for dinner, okay?</i>


00:09:17.037 --> 00:09:17.993
<i>Marc?</i>


00:11:03.594 --> 00:11:05.883
Help... me...


00:11:09.933 --> 00:11:12.302
Every morning
I send a boyfriend to work...


00:11:12.602 --> 00:11:13.935
And this is what you get back.


00:11:20.943 --> 00:11:22.560
Look. Do you like it?


00:11:23.738 --> 00:11:27.188
- It's terrifying.
- I might not sell this one.


00:11:27.867 --> 00:11:29.450
I think I'd rather keep it.


00:11:31.286 --> 00:11:32.449
Julia...


00:11:32.621 --> 00:11:34.204
Not for now.


00:11:34.415 --> 00:11:37.991
For when we decide to.
Or when you do.


00:11:38.919 --> 00:11:40.958
It's not about me deciding to.


00:11:41.296 --> 00:11:42.879
It's the timing.


00:11:43.298 --> 00:11:45.917
We have a kid now and then what?


00:11:46.092 --> 00:11:49.133
That bastard from Human Resources
is breathing down my neck.


00:11:49.262 --> 00:11:52.803
Who knows if I'll be able
to pay the rent?


00:11:53.098 --> 00:11:54.385
Bastards...


00:11:55.518 --> 00:11:57.430
Should I heat something up
for you?


00:12:29.466 --> 00:12:34.671
<i>Meanwhile more than a dozen airports
remain closed due to volcanic ash</i>


00:12:34.887 --> 00:12:36.345
<i>from Mount Hek/a.</i>


00:12:36.514 --> 00:12:38.678
<i>Ltk the third eruption this year</i>


00:12:38.891 --> 00:12:40.758
<i>and the ashes have reached
Southern Europe.</i>


00:12:41.018 --> 00:12:45.562
<i>And nom shocking footage
from Canada</i>


00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:49.891
<i>where 16-year-old Greg Laffe/fy
took his own life last Saturday</i>


00:12:50.068 --> 00:12:53.029
<i>after spending more than 6 months
shut in his house.</i>


00:13:37.738 --> 00:13:39.400
<i>His parents found his body...</i>


00:13:39.572 --> 00:13:40.735
Oh, my God.


00:13:41.534 --> 00:13:44.733
I've seen it 4 times
and it still gives me the chills.


00:13:44.952 --> 00:13:46.992
Maybe it's like
those Japanese kids.


00:13:47.164 --> 00:13:50.238
The ones who stay home all day
playing video games...


00:13:50.583 --> 00:13:52.747
But that's in Japan.


00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:54.669
There are fucked-up kids
everywhere.


00:13:57.590 --> 00:13:59.548
- Rovira, watch it.
- Sorry.


00:14:01.176 --> 00:14:02.760
He's wearing the same suit again?


00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:05.543
When was the last time
he changed?


00:14:05.681 --> 00:14:08.266
When was the last time he showered?


00:14:09.059 --> 00:14:12.384
- Did you see the Japanese kid?
- What?


00:14:36.042 --> 00:14:37.079
What do you want?


00:14:37.418 --> 00:14:39.378
I told you.
To find my girlfriend.


00:14:39.546 --> 00:14:40.377
And?


00:14:40.546 --> 00:14:43.462
I need a GPS
to navigate down there.


00:14:44.008 --> 00:14:45.374
Any cell phone has GPS.


00:14:45.926 --> 00:14:49.719
They all use cell phone towers
which don't work anymore.


00:14:50.264 --> 00:14:53.305
But the satellites still do.
At least for now.


00:14:53.642 --> 00:14:55.384
But you already know that.


00:14:55.811 --> 00:14:57.803
Or you wouldn't have stolen it.


00:14:59.106 --> 00:15:00.141
Stolen it?


00:15:01.399 --> 00:15:04.599
Do you want to go out there
and ask the others what they think?


00:15:05.987 --> 00:15:07.900
Again: What do you want?


00:15:15.162 --> 00:15:17.120
You can't go anywhere
without a flashlight.


00:15:17.498 --> 00:15:19.331
Maybe in the subway tunnels,


00:15:19.457 --> 00:15:22.202
but when you reach the sewers
you won't see a thing.


00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:26.839
Take me to Julia and it's all yours.


00:15:27.424 --> 00:15:29.838
You can go to Vila Olimpica
or wherever you want.


00:15:31.594 --> 00:15:33.427
Where did you get all this?


00:15:35.681 --> 00:15:36.843
Rovira.


00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:44.517
Keep it, I'm not interested.


00:15:53.823 --> 00:15:56.408
Okay, we'll just ask
the others then.


00:15:56.951 --> 00:15:58.066
You're a piece of shit.


00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:03.494
We've been shut in here
for three fucking months.


00:16:03.666 --> 00:16:05.909
I don't know if she's dead or alive.
I'm a piece of shit?


00:16:07.294 --> 00:16:08.832
I don't care.


00:16:09.296 --> 00:16:11.380
So make up your mind.


00:16:11.632 --> 00:16:12.872
Yes or no?


00:16:20.723 --> 00:16:22.214
Shut the door.


00:16:33.903 --> 00:16:35.234
Good luck.


00:16:35.404 --> 00:16:37.362
We'll see each other again.


00:16:37.823 --> 00:16:38.814
Definitely.


00:16:41.576 --> 00:16:42.568
Definitely.


00:17:00.009 --> 00:17:01.297
How's the reception?


00:17:01.553 --> 00:17:05.424
There's a lot of interference.
It's faint, but it's there.


00:17:08.517 --> 00:17:10.261
- Maybe if we go deeper...
- Hands off.


00:17:14.648 --> 00:17:17.848
Turn it off at least.
You're wasting battery.


00:17:18.152 --> 00:17:21.443
We won't need it
until we reach the sewers.


00:17:28.245 --> 00:17:29.953
Line 3 takes us to Sants,


00:17:30.204 --> 00:17:32.369
then we switch to line 5
straight to Verdaguer.


00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:34.749
Line 4 takes you to Vila Olimpica.


00:18:16.248 --> 00:18:16.989
Let's go.


00:18:35.516 --> 00:18:36.427
Fuck.


00:19:15.845 --> 00:19:17.303
Give me the bottle back!


00:19:17.555 --> 00:19:18.762
That's my water!


00:19:20.266 --> 00:19:21.223
Give it back!


00:19:23.561 --> 00:19:24.551
The GPS!


00:19:25.229 --> 00:19:26.311
Hey, you!


00:19:29.441 --> 00:19:31.309
- Move!
- Run!


00:19:31.735 --> 00:19:32.897
Move!


00:20:25.076 --> 00:20:26.067
Javi!


00:20:29.414 --> 00:20:31.828
- What are you doing?
- Hands off, damn it!


00:20:32.875 --> 00:20:34.037
What the fuck is going on?


00:20:34.627 --> 00:20:36.710
That son of a bitch...


00:20:37.337 --> 00:20:39.330
Who, him?


00:20:41.717 --> 00:20:43.629
This son of a bitch is my brother.


00:20:44.554 --> 00:20:46.262
What does that make me?


00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.468
Another son of a bitch, right?


00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:49.756
<i>No, no.</i>


00:20:49.933 --> 00:20:52.598
Look, we don't want any trouble.
Really.


00:20:52.727 --> 00:20:54.218
The kid stole our bag.


00:20:54.604 --> 00:20:55.561
Okay?


00:20:56.147 --> 00:20:57.684
We just want it back.


00:20:57.857 --> 00:20:59.063
And we'll go.


00:20:59.942 --> 00:21:00.900
Right.


00:21:02.027 --> 00:21:02.984
Or else...?


00:21:05.448 --> 00:21:06.689
Or else what?


00:21:07.449 --> 00:21:09.363
You'll find a cop?


00:21:13.538 --> 00:21:14.370
Shit.


00:21:14.832 --> 00:21:16.369
Don't worry, kid.


00:21:16.666 --> 00:21:19.957
You think this is still worth
anything?


00:21:21.087 --> 00:21:23.502
The only thing that still means
something...


00:21:24.423 --> 00:21:25.414
is this.


00:21:26.384 --> 00:21:27.465
On your knees.


00:21:27.634 --> 00:21:28.967
- Okay, okay.
- Let me go.


00:21:29.928 --> 00:21:30.885
Javi.


00:21:32.347 --> 00:21:33.339
Does it work?


00:21:40.063 --> 00:21:41.304
Very smart.


00:21:43.483 --> 00:21:45.396
What have you got in there?


00:21:48.696 --> 00:21:49.983
I asked you a question.


00:21:50.155 --> 00:21:53.276
- Grab the GPS when I say.
- What are you gonna do?


00:21:53.659 --> 00:21:56.494
I said... what have you got...


00:21:56.954 --> 00:21:57.739
in there?


00:21:57.912 --> 00:21:59.279
- Just grab the GPS.
- But...


00:22:38.660 --> 00:22:39.650
Marc?


00:22:41.621 --> 00:22:42.452
Marc!


00:22:42.746 --> 00:22:43.738
Yes!


00:22:47.251 --> 00:22:48.492
Have you got it?


00:22:49.545 --> 00:22:50.786
Yes.


00:22:52.005 --> 00:22:53.246
Are you ready?


00:22:53.464 --> 00:22:54.877
Ready for what?


00:22:56.717 --> 00:22:57.675
Run!


00:23:03.850 --> 00:23:05.387
Move!


00:23:05.851 --> 00:23:07.138
Move!


00:23:35.087 --> 00:23:37.000
What the fuck happened?


00:23:37.714 --> 00:23:38.797
Does it work?


00:23:39.007 --> 00:23:41.046
What happened?
I didn't see anything.


00:23:44.429 --> 00:23:45.841
- Did you kill him?
- Does it work?


00:23:55.189 --> 00:23:56.225
Please...


00:24:03.154 --> 00:24:04.271
Can I have it back?


00:24:19.129 --> 00:24:21.041
This is when you ditch me, right?


00:24:36.227 --> 00:24:37.560
You and I made a deal.


00:24:39.063 --> 00:24:40.976
And we don't need
any more enemies.


00:24:45.903 --> 00:24:46.895
What?


00:25:11.594 --> 00:25:14.715
<i>Good morning, it's 7 A.M.,
six in the Canary ls/ands.</i>


00:25:14.888 --> 00:25:18.384
<i>I'm Manuel Ouintero sitting in for
Pedro Lamas who has been ill.</i>


00:25:18.600 --> 00:25:20.969
<i>Hek the third one this wee/r,</i>


00:25:21.186 --> 00:25:24.147
<i>including Emma and Julian.</i>


00:25:24.314 --> 00:25:28.643
<i>We wish them a/l a quick recovery.
Here are today's headlines.</i>


00:25:57.595 --> 00:25:58.506
Hello?


00:26:59.403 --> 00:27:01.692
What the fuck are you doing here?


00:27:01.946 --> 00:27:03.859
I knocked but you didn't answer.


00:27:03.990 --> 00:27:05.903
I thought something
had happened to you.


00:27:06.035 --> 00:27:07.116
What do you care?


00:27:07.577 --> 00:27:09.785
- What do I care?
- What's my name?


00:27:10.121 --> 00:27:11.783
- Well?
- I don't know.


00:27:11.914 --> 00:27:14.989
You have no fucking clue.
You never even say hello to me.


00:27:15.125 --> 00:27:18.325
And now you come into my home?


00:27:19.713 --> 00:27:20.954
How long have you been in here?


00:27:21.006 --> 00:27:22.088
What are you talking about?


00:27:23.300 --> 00:27:25.465
When was the last time
you went outside?


00:27:30.933 --> 00:27:32.641
Months ago...


00:27:40.858 --> 00:27:43.773
Every day I try to leave the building
but I can't.


00:27:45.987 --> 00:27:47.149
You haven't talked to anyone?


00:27:47.614 --> 00:27:48.730
What do I tell them?


00:27:52.786 --> 00:27:55.155
That I'm afraid to go outside?


00:28:09.301 --> 00:28:11.887
No, no, no.
You don't understand.


00:28:12.054 --> 00:28:14.172
You have no right to do this to me!


00:28:15.099 --> 00:28:18.345
- Okay.
- Please, just...


00:28:20.854 --> 00:28:22.767
- Please...
- Let's go.


00:28:22.897 --> 00:28:23.888
Let go of me!


00:28:24.065 --> 00:28:25.022
What's going on?


00:28:25.734 --> 00:28:28.148
Rovira. The first to go.


00:28:28.820 --> 00:28:30.357
- Already?
- Wait.


00:28:31.572 --> 00:28:33.189
You forgot this.


00:28:34.242 --> 00:28:36.781
But that's not the best part.


00:28:38.120 --> 00:28:40.329
They found food hidden
in a cabinet.


00:28:41.831 --> 00:28:45.031
The nutjob had been sleeping here
for weeks.


00:28:46.128 --> 00:28:48.919
- Here?
- Here, in the office.


00:28:50.297 --> 00:28:52.256
The guy never went home.


00:28:52.842 --> 00:28:54.585
Hold still, damn it! Let's go!


00:28:54.801 --> 00:28:56.339
I can't go outside! No, no!


00:29:07.063 --> 00:29:08.555
<i>Please, no...</i>


00:29:09.315 --> 00:29:11.058
<i>Please, no...</i>


00:29:11.734 --> 00:29:13.477
- Let's go.
- No, no!


00:29:14.112 --> 00:29:15.774
Help! Help!


00:29:18.198 --> 00:29:19.315
Please, don't...


00:29:23.871 --> 00:29:26.160
Let go. Come on, let go.


00:29:27.457 --> 00:29:28.322
Let g9!


00:29:29.251 --> 00:29:30.242
Let g9!


00:29:44.849 --> 00:29:45.714
Come on, damn it!


00:29:48.393 --> 00:29:49.601
What's wrong with him?


00:29:51.146 --> 00:29:52.137
Wait!


00:29:52.648 --> 00:29:53.308
Put him down.


00:29:58.445 --> 00:29:59.902
We need an ambulance.


00:30:00.906 --> 00:30:02.568
We need an ambulance.
It's urgent.


00:30:02.782 --> 00:30:05.777
There's a man...
it looks like he's having a seizure.


00:30:08.204 --> 00:30:09.412
Take him inside.


00:30:09.747 --> 00:30:10.737
What?


00:30:12.333 --> 00:30:13.620
Grab his legs.


00:30:17.171 --> 00:30:18.788
Grab his legs, damn it!


00:30:18.964 --> 00:30:20.171
One, two, three!


00:30:21.174 --> 00:30:22.256
Move!


00:30:22.759 --> 00:30:23.920
Move, damn it!


00:30:41.776 --> 00:30:42.939
He's dead.


00:31:06.174 --> 00:31:10.172
How awful. It looks like the same
thing my sister told me about.


00:31:34.034 --> 00:31:35.025
Marc?


00:31:46.837 --> 00:31:47.999
Marc?


00:31:49.048 --> 00:31:50.165
What's wrong?


00:31:50.299 --> 00:31:52.589
Spying on the neighbors?


00:31:53.260 --> 00:31:55.675
- Maybe.
- Why?


00:31:56.054 --> 00:31:57.046
I don't know.


00:31:58.973 --> 00:32:01.889
Have you noticed anything weird
at work?


00:32:02.060 --> 00:32:03.848
Weird how?


00:32:04.395 --> 00:32:05.512
Yeah...


00:32:06.980 --> 00:32:10.899
Shops closed, people not showing up
for a while...


00:32:12.195 --> 00:32:15.111
Well, one or two are closed, but...


00:32:15.488 --> 00:32:18.199
that's normal for a shopping mall.
Why?


00:32:20.786 --> 00:32:21.993
What's wrong?


00:32:22.370 --> 00:32:23.487
Are you okay?


00:32:25.123 --> 00:32:26.706
You're not sleeping.


00:32:27.125 --> 00:32:29.539
- Yes, I am.
- Two hours isn't sleeping.


00:32:29.711 --> 00:32:31.295
I sleep, it's not that.


00:32:31.463 --> 00:32:33.080
Then what is it?


00:32:35.132 --> 00:32:36.123
What?


00:32:39.554 --> 00:32:41.512
Somebody died at work today.


00:32:41.680 --> 00:32:42.922
Oh, my God.


00:32:43.890 --> 00:32:44.596
Who?


00:32:44.766 --> 00:32:45.632
Rovira.


00:32:46.267 --> 00:32:47.885
Rovira... Do I know him?


00:32:48.062 --> 00:32:49.599
I didn't either...


00:32:51.982 --> 00:32:55.728
I only spoke to him a couple times.


00:32:58.488 --> 00:33:00.652
He had a heart attack.


00:33:00.823 --> 00:33:01.814
My love...


00:33:02.699 --> 00:33:04.989
He died in my arms, Julia.


00:33:05.286 --> 00:33:06.743
And he was terrified.


00:33:10.249 --> 00:33:12.117
Something's happening.


00:33:13.293 --> 00:33:16.038
Something's happening
and we're missing it.


00:33:58.085 --> 00:33:59.417
Motherfucker...


00:34:09.012 --> 00:34:10.674
Motherfucker!


00:34:12.557 --> 00:34:15.017
A motherfucker
who keeps his word.


00:34:15.601 --> 00:34:17.219
Waterproof.


00:34:19.730 --> 00:34:20.720
Shall we?


00:34:36.705 --> 00:34:39.369
- What's in Vila Olimpica?
- Excuse me?


00:34:39.749 --> 00:34:43.164
Are you looking for someone?
Your wife?


00:34:44.587 --> 00:34:45.999
Your girlfriend?


00:34:47.798 --> 00:34:50.873
Oh, so it's a secret, sorry.


00:34:52.469 --> 00:34:55.214
- You have a bunker with canned food?
- Look.


00:34:55.388 --> 00:34:58.133
Once we get to your place,
we part ways.


00:35:06.440 --> 00:35:07.432
Seeds.


00:35:16.449 --> 00:35:17.782
A drain.


00:35:19.369 --> 00:35:21.613
It should lead to the sewers.


00:35:52.816 --> 00:35:54.149
Shit.


00:35:58.739 --> 00:35:59.696
Okay?


00:36:23.804 --> 00:36:25.296
We're close!


00:36:27.516 --> 00:36:31.387
35, 36, 37...


00:36:31.561 --> 00:36:35.229
".38, 39, 40."


00:36:37.984 --> 00:36:38.850
Here.


00:36:42.655 --> 00:36:45.275
We should be right under
my building.


00:36:48.410 --> 00:36:49.527
What if I miss?


00:36:52.206 --> 00:36:54.119
If you miss
we'll be stuck down here.


00:36:54.333 --> 00:36:55.449
So we can't miss.


00:37:06.135 --> 00:37:07.126
Ready?


00:37:26.529 --> 00:37:27.486
Fuck!


00:37:32.244 --> 00:37:33.450
Shit!


00:37:35.288 --> 00:37:36.073
You Okay?


00:37:37.832 --> 00:37:39.198
Yeah.


00:37:43.087 --> 00:37:44.327
Can I try?


00:37:53.263 --> 00:37:54.676
Hold your breath.


00:37:55.515 --> 00:37:57.474
So your hand won't shake.


00:38:31.799 --> 00:38:33.963
Marc... Last bullet.


00:38:45.436 --> 00:38:46.894
Remember not to breathe...


00:39:00.993 --> 00:39:02.074
Marc!


00:39:03.704 --> 00:39:05.491
Marc! Are you okay?


00:39:06.373 --> 00:39:07.704
Marc, answer me!


00:39:09.000 --> 00:39:10.833
Marc, answer me.


00:39:23.514 --> 00:39:24.925
Marc!


00:39:25.682 --> 00:39:27.300
Can you hear me?


00:39:27.767 --> 00:39:29.134
Are you okay?


00:39:33.272 --> 00:39:34.560
You did it.


00:39:37.151 --> 00:39:39.485
I don't know how, but you did it!


00:39:45.326 --> 00:39:46.487
Jesus Christ.


00:39:47.202 --> 00:39:48.160
Look at that.


00:40:39.376 --> 00:40:40.617
What is it?


00:40:55.016 --> 00:40:56.006
Who are you?


00:40:57.268 --> 00:40:58.259
Open the door.


00:41:00.062 --> 00:41:01.350
Open the door.


00:41:01.730 --> 00:41:03.939
Open the door, motherfucker!


00:41:04.775 --> 00:41:06.062
Open the door!


00:41:08.611 --> 00:41:09.398
Julia!


00:41:09.697 --> 00:41:10.197
Julia!


00:41:14.033 --> 00:41:15.696
What did you do to Julia?


00:41:24.042 --> 00:41:25.205
Where is she?


00:41:25.419 --> 00:41:27.287
Put down the knife!


00:41:39.015 --> 00:41:40.802
Stop! Stop!


00:41:42.227 --> 00:41:43.593
Please, stop!


00:41:44.854 --> 00:41:46.813
We had nowhere else to go.


00:41:47.648 --> 00:41:51.144
We couldn't go outside
and the place was empty.


00:41:52.862 --> 00:41:53.978
Is it yours?


00:41:56.573 --> 00:41:57.564
Yeah.


00:42:28.269 --> 00:42:30.183
Have you seen this girl?


00:42:34.441 --> 00:42:35.433
House empty.


00:42:35.610 --> 00:42:37.568
Are you sure? Look closely.


00:42:40.572 --> 00:42:42.611
- House empty.
- Really.


00:42:53.834 --> 00:42:55.122
We're going to look around.


00:43:28.159 --> 00:43:29.274
No, it's okay.


00:44:43.396 --> 00:44:44.431
Fuck...


00:44:46.940 --> 00:44:48.352
Did you know?


00:44:53.488 --> 00:44:56.654
<i>Two weeks after
the first death in Spain,</i>


00:44:56.824 --> 00:45:02.029
<i>repo/fs from countries like the U.S.,
Germany and Korea confirm</i>


00:45:02.246 --> 00:45:06.574
<i>"that the phenomenon
known as 'The Panic" is global.</i>


00:45:06.792 --> 00:45:11.337
<i>A man died this morning in A/icante
when he left his home in his car</i>


00:45:11.505 --> 00:45:15.172
<i>proving that vehicles
offer no protection</i>


00:45:15.300 --> 00:45:16.132
<i>from The Panic.</i>


00:45:16.427 --> 00:45:19.752
<i>However, the government
has cal/ed for calm.</i>


00:45:19.930 --> 00:45:24.178
<i>I assure you the government is
taking all the necessary measures.</i>


00:45:24.309 --> 00:45:29.103
<i>We ask the pub/ic to keep working
and shopping.</i>


00:45:29.480 --> 00:45:32.440
<i>To stay calm
and go about their lives.</i>


00:45:32.650 --> 00:45:33.607
Calm?


00:45:34.484 --> 00:45:37.103
He wants us to stay calm?
Can you believe this?


00:45:37.279 --> 00:45:39.238
“No sweat, everybody.“


00:45:40.073 --> 00:45:42.738
We still don't know.
Let's wait and see, right?


00:45:42.909 --> 00:45:44.151
There's nothing to see.


00:45:44.954 --> 00:45:46.069
Everything's perfect.


00:45:47.957 --> 00:45:50.291
The world's falling apart
and we're looking the other way,


00:45:50.459 --> 00:45:52.076
but everything's fine.


00:45:52.251 --> 00:45:53.459
That's enough, Marc.


00:45:53.670 --> 00:45:55.332
<i>More and more women can'! Go outside</i>


00:45:55.504 --> 00:45:57.998
<i>and have had to give birth
in unsafe conditions...</i>


00:45:58.549 --> 00:46:02.375
And these schmucks
are having babies. Unbelievable.


00:46:04.137 --> 00:46:06.723
Only schmucks have babies now?


00:46:07.057 --> 00:46:10.132
In a situation like this?
Yes, definitely.


00:46:11.060 --> 00:46:13.725
But the world's been going to shit
for a while now


00:46:13.896 --> 00:46:15.684
and that never stopped anyone.


00:46:16.523 --> 00:46:18.392
Who would even do that?


00:46:21.070 --> 00:46:23.029
Why did you wait until now
to tell me?


00:46:26.659 --> 00:46:27.865
Tell you what?


00:46:28.202 --> 00:46:30.571
Tell me what? Jesus, Marc.


00:46:31.747 --> 00:46:33.740
You've been making excuses
for years.


00:46:34.040 --> 00:46:36.785
When we get a bigger apartment,
when I get a raise...


00:46:36.960 --> 00:46:38.242
- lt's not that.
- Of course not.


00:46:38.336 --> 00:46:40.751
You're terrified of having kids.


00:46:42.548 --> 00:46:43.756
And you're not?


00:46:44.592 --> 00:46:47.052
Have you looked out the window
lately?


00:46:48.346 --> 00:46:50.588
How long were you going
to string me along?


00:46:53.350 --> 00:46:55.593
Until I dropped the subject?


00:46:57.104 --> 00:46:59.062
Or until I couldn't anymore?


00:47:00.274 --> 00:47:01.389
Julia...


00:47:04.152 --> 00:47:05.314
Julia, please.


00:47:07.280 --> 00:47:08.738
Don't listen to me.


00:47:10.366 --> 00:47:12.028
Come out and let's talk.


00:47:13.995 --> 00:47:14.951
Julia.


00:47:16.705 --> 00:47:17.695
Julia.


00:47:19.500 --> 00:47:20.615
Damn it!


00:47:22.378 --> 00:47:24.040
Fine, I'm leaving.


00:47:26.047 --> 00:47:28.633
Keep working and shopping,
everything's fine.


00:47:33.596 --> 00:47:37.547
<i>The scientific community remains
unable to find the cause...</i>


00:47:38.017 --> 00:47:40.602
<i>Still awaiting the new repan'
from the WHO,</i>


00:47:40.811 --> 00:47:43.431
<i>health officia/s
continue to follow</i>


00:47:43.814 --> 00:47:46.855
<i>basic prevention guidelines
for contagious diseases.</i>


00:47:47.526 --> 00:47:49.359
<i>They all show classic s ymptams
0f a panic attack.</i>


00:47:49.486 --> 00:47:51.946
<i>- Panic to what?
- Going outside.</i>


00:47:52.155 --> 00:47:54.438
<i>We 're talking about agoraphobia,
the victims of the Panic</i>


00:47:54.574 --> 00:47:57.365
<i>develop an irrational fear
0f open spaces.</i>


00:47:58.161 --> 00:47:59.778
<i>The sudden spread of the disease
after Mount Hec/a 's eruption</i>


00:47:59.954 --> 00:48:01.538
<i>might indicate that the agoraphobia</i>


00:48:01.747 --> 00:48:05.414
<i>is the result of a virus released
from an unknown geological stratum.</i>


00:48:05.542 --> 00:48:08.617
<i>We're dealing with a case
0f mass hysteria.</i>


00:48:08.879 --> 00:48:11.748
<i>How else can we explain
the disease</i>


00:48:11.966 --> 00:48:13.297
<i>striking complete/y at random?</i>


00:48:13.425 --> 00:48:16.010
<i>N0 pattern to the epidemic
has been found.</i>


00:48:16.511 --> 00:48:19.505
<i>Severe allergies to dust,
pollution, hairspray...</i>


00:48:19.681 --> 00:48:23.222
<i>Are you suggesting people
are becoming allergic to the world?</i>


00:48:23.392 --> 00:48:25.761
<i>We are clear/y facing
a biological agent</i>


00:48:25.979 --> 00:48:28.643
<i>spread by the ash cloud...</i>


00:48:28.898 --> 00:48:30.606
They're fucking clueless!


00:48:30.816 --> 00:48:32.683
They're making it up
as they go along.


00:48:32.901 --> 00:48:35.270
Sure they know. They're just lying
through their teeth.


00:48:35.445 --> 00:48:37.940
They already have a vaccine,
but not enough for everyone.


00:48:38.448 --> 00:48:42.822
The king, the Pope
and their mothers come first.


00:48:42.995 --> 00:48:46.161
Jesus, you need to stop listening
to cab drivers.


00:48:46.330 --> 00:48:48.198
This is a hoax.


00:48:54.464 --> 00:48:55.420
<i>Yes p.</i>


00:48:55.589 --> 00:48:56.546
Hey...


00:48:56.966 --> 00:49:00.087
I'm sorry, okay?
I don't know what's wrong with me.


00:49:00.219 --> 00:49:01.836
Marc, it's me, Andrea.


00:49:02.053 --> 00:49:03.966
<i>Andrea? Where? Julia?</i>


00:49:04.139 --> 00:49:06.884
<i>- /s something wrong with her?
- No, she's fine.</i>


00:49:07.058 --> 00:49:08.720
But she can't talk right now.


00:49:08.934 --> 00:49:10.472
Can't or won't?


00:49:11.187 --> 00:49:12.269
<i>Come on, Marc.</i>


00:49:12.480 --> 00:49:14.392
Please, put her on.


00:49:14.523 --> 00:49:15.890
Don't make this harder for her.


00:49:16.943 --> 00:49:20.814
Look, this is between me and her,
okay? Put her on.


00:49:20.988 --> 00:49:22.696
She doesn't want to talk to you.


00:49:23.240 --> 00:49:24.949
Why the fuck are you meddling?


00:49:25.284 --> 00:49:26.741
<i>- Jesus, Marc...
- Look.</i>


00:49:27.119 --> 00:49:28.702
I'm coming over there, okay?


00:49:29.538 --> 00:49:31.530
Tell her I want to talk to her
in person.


00:49:31.706 --> 00:49:33.664
<i>Don't be stubborn.
Give her some space.</i>


00:49:33.874 --> 00:49:36.164
Please, just stay there.
All right?


00:49:36.378 --> 00:49:39.543
Tell her I'm on my way.
I need her to listen to me.


00:49:39.880 --> 00:49:40.872
Andrea?


00:49:42.841 --> 00:49:44.049
Damn it!


00:49:44.218 --> 00:49:46.587
<i>I'm talking about hypersensitivity.</i>


00:49:46.762 --> 00:49:49.256
<i>About a lifestyle so aseptic...</i>


00:49:49.390 --> 00:49:51.507
<i>that it's left us
without natural defenses.</i>


00:51:08.255 --> 00:51:09.246
Marc!


00:51:11.758 --> 00:51:13.296
Come on, come on!


00:51:30.151 --> 00:51:30.936
Ready?


00:54:14.845 --> 00:54:16.177
That way, I think.


00:54:18.390 --> 00:54:19.473
To go where?


00:54:20.017 --> 00:54:22.728
Julia must be at the mall.
In her shop.


00:54:23.603 --> 00:54:24.514
No.


00:54:31.278 --> 00:54:31.938
We have a deal.


00:54:32.278 --> 00:54:36.607
The deal was to go to Verdaguer.
Now we're going to Vila Olimpica.


00:54:36.783 --> 00:54:38.274
No. She wasn't there.


00:54:38.576 --> 00:54:39.534
That's your problem.


00:54:40.202 --> 00:54:43.653
We're not gonna search all Barcelona
until we find her.


00:54:44.623 --> 00:54:47.698
You go ahead.
But without the GPS and flashlight.


00:54:48.376 --> 00:54:49.333
Listen to rne.


00:54:49.878 --> 00:54:52.463
- Will you listen to me?
- Don't make me.


00:54:53.549 --> 00:54:55.666
Don't make me
because I'll do it.


00:55:01.931 --> 00:55:05.472
She's pregnant.
We're having a baby.


00:55:05.601 --> 00:55:08.346
If she hasn't already lost it.
If she's still alive.


00:55:08.520 --> 00:55:09.682
Son of a bitch!


00:55:21.991 --> 00:55:22.949
Shit!


00:55:25.954 --> 00:55:26.911
Here!


00:55:27.246 --> 00:55:28.830
Your fucking flashlight!


00:55:32.752 --> 00:55:34.414
I have a girlfriend.


00:55:34.587 --> 00:55:35.668
A baby!


00:55:36.046 --> 00:55:38.164
What the fuck have you got?


00:55:38.298 --> 00:55:39.585
My father!


00:55:49.517 --> 00:55:52.057
He had a stroke three months ago
and he can barely move.


00:55:53.437 --> 00:55:55.806
He's a patient
at Del Mar Hospital.


00:55:59.985 --> 00:56:03.232
I took you to your place,
that was the deal.


00:56:04.072 --> 00:56:05.485
Now it's my turn.


00:56:22.089 --> 00:56:23.831
You're gonna stay here
with the rats?


00:56:25.467 --> 00:56:28.087
Let's find a flashlight,
go to the hospital


00:56:28.304 --> 00:56:29.887
and then the GPS is all yours.


00:56:52.534 --> 00:56:53.492
This way.


00:57:43.415 --> 00:57:45.157
Will we see anything with that?


00:57:45.376 --> 00:57:47.665
No, but we will with torches.


00:57:50.380 --> 00:57:53.546
The priest liked
more than just altar wine.


00:59:28.012 --> 00:59:29.425
Hungry, huh?


00:59:32.851 --> 00:59:33.762
Come on!


01:00:07.341 --> 01:00:08.503
Now what?


01:00:08.634 --> 01:00:10.422
Throw away the torch.


01:00:10.552 --> 01:00:12.295
- What?
- Throw it away!


01:00:19.978 --> 01:00:20.844
Marc!


01:00:50.214 --> 01:00:51.171
Marc?


01:01:24.955 --> 01:01:26.072
Thanks.


01:01:26.748 --> 01:01:27.910
For what?


01:01:28.084 --> 01:01:29.746
For before.


01:01:30.877 --> 01:01:32.118
For not leaving.


01:01:32.295 --> 01:01:34.208
I needed the GPS.


01:01:34.590 --> 01:01:35.580
Right.


01:01:36.758 --> 01:01:39.674
It's my job to know
when people are lying.


01:01:41.512 --> 01:01:43.050
I never lied to you.


01:01:43.222 --> 01:01:45.262
The protocol was going to be ready.


01:01:47.643 --> 01:01:50.718
It doesn't matter.
Someone had to go.


01:01:55.192 --> 01:01:56.810
You were gonna fire me?


01:02:09.580 --> 01:02:10.743
Bastard!


01:02:14.627 --> 01:02:16.916
Last year they sent rne to Madrid.


01:02:17.045 --> 01:02:19.379
An energy management company.


01:02:19.714 --> 01:02:22.334
Over-staffed, the usual.


01:02:23.135 --> 01:02:26.631
The head of Human Resources
wasn't answering my emails.


01:02:26.763 --> 01:02:29.758
I asked for his office
and when I opened the door...


01:02:31.350 --> 01:02:32.638
I found him dead.


01:02:32.894 --> 01:02:35.639
- Sudden heart attack.
- Damn.


01:02:35.772 --> 01:02:38.391
- He'd been lying there for 4 days.
- You're kidding.


01:02:38.940 --> 01:02:42.357
He was divorced. People at work
thought he was at home.


01:02:43.111 --> 01:02:45.275
And nobody was waiting for him
at home.


01:02:47.074 --> 01:02:48.405
And I thought...


01:02:49.200 --> 01:02:52.741
When my dad's gone,
the same will happen to me.


01:02:54.414 --> 01:02:56.031
Nobody will notice.


01:03:03.130 --> 01:03:04.793
What did your dad do?


01:03:05.633 --> 01:03:06.623
My dad?


01:03:08.385 --> 01:03:11.802
My dad can hardly read,


01:03:12.346 --> 01:03:13.838
he can barely write...


01:03:15.892 --> 01:03:18.808
He came to the city
without a penny to his name...


01:03:20.063 --> 01:03:24.231
and worked his whole life
so that I could go to school.


01:03:25.651 --> 01:03:26.733
But I can say...


01:03:27.695 --> 01:03:30.440
he's got everything he needs now,
I see to that.


01:03:33.659 --> 01:03:34.615
Well,


01:03:35.618 --> 01:03:36.906
I used to.


01:03:39.331 --> 01:03:41.118
It was a way to...


01:03:44.961 --> 01:03:47.079
My dad and I aren't big talkers.


01:03:47.714 --> 01:03:49.331
We're both very macho.


01:03:50.007 --> 01:03:53.173
The last time I saw him
we talked politics, soccer...


01:03:54.720 --> 01:03:57.636
So many damn things
we never talked about...


01:04:03.019 --> 01:04:05.183
The last time I talked to Julia...


01:04:06.022 --> 01:04:08.185
I told her I didn't want children.


01:04:11.444 --> 01:04:12.936
Don't laugh, asshole.


01:04:13.863 --> 01:04:15.447
Congratulations, kid.


01:04:15.740 --> 01:04:17.858
You win.
I can't compete with that.


01:04:20.577 --> 01:04:21.784
It's not that.


01:04:22.662 --> 01:04:24.905
Of course I want children with her.


01:04:28.167 --> 01:04:29.580
I was scared.


01:04:30.087 --> 01:04:31.168
Scared?


01:04:32.339 --> 01:04:33.796
Yeah, I don't know...


01:04:34.340 --> 01:04:35.957
That I'd screw up.


01:04:38.969 --> 01:04:40.883
That I couldn't protect him.


01:04:43.099 --> 01:04:45.341
If I was scared before,
what about now?


01:04:46.769 --> 01:04:48.887
How the hell
am I going to protect him?


01:04:51.231 --> 01:04:52.973
You think this is the end?


01:04:55.110 --> 01:04:56.191
Don't you?


01:04:58.863 --> 01:05:00.151
Who knows...


01:05:02.116 --> 01:05:04.155
When the radio was still working


01:05:04.326 --> 01:05:08.324
they said they'd found tribes
in Australia immune to The Panic.


01:05:09.790 --> 01:05:10.781
Nomads.


01:05:11.834 --> 01:05:13.998
With boomerangs and loincloths.


01:05:16.422 --> 01:05:18.039
In the end,


01:05:18.173 --> 01:05:20.587
they'll rule the fucking world.


01:05:22.385 --> 01:05:24.719
Maybe they know something we don't.


01:05:29.767 --> 01:05:32.477
We may still have time to learn.


01:05:37.732 --> 01:05:41.775
For 25 pesetas,
name possible causes of The Panic.


01:05:41.904 --> 01:05:45.104
For example, Mount Hekla.
One, two, three, answer again.


01:05:45.240 --> 01:05:46.527
Mount Hekla.


01:05:46.991 --> 01:05:49.360
Cell phone radiation.


01:05:50.829 --> 01:05:52.868
Bacteriological weapons.


01:05:53.540 --> 01:05:55.248
Aliens.


01:05:56.250 --> 01:05:58.289
- Aliens?
- Sure.


01:05:58.544 --> 01:06:00.161
Why not?


01:06:41.626 --> 01:06:43.585
I just want a light.


01:06:43.878 --> 01:06:46.042
We have cigarettes but no light


01:06:46.214 --> 01:06:47.671
and you obviously do.


01:06:59.726 --> 01:07:01.309
Where are you coming from?


01:07:01.686 --> 01:07:02.643
Verdaguer.


01:07:03.604 --> 01:07:04.687
How is it?


01:07:05.231 --> 01:07:06.848
We've seen worse.


01:07:08.234 --> 01:07:10.728
- Avoid Sants Station if you can.
- Thanks.


01:07:12.905 --> 01:07:13.942
Where are you going?


01:07:14.115 --> 01:07:15.481
To Clinico Hospital.


01:07:16.158 --> 01:07:17.445
My sister needs a doctor.


01:07:18.326 --> 01:07:20.820
Have you tried Del Mar Hospital?
It's nearby.


01:07:21.163 --> 01:07:23.406
- We're headed there.
- What for?


01:07:23.581 --> 01:07:24.823
My father's a patient.


01:07:27.043 --> 01:07:27.876
What's wrong?


01:07:38.470 --> 01:07:39.711
What did she say?


01:07:43.099 --> 01:07:44.262
What rumor?


01:07:45.686 --> 01:07:47.143
What the fuck happened?


01:07:47.271 --> 01:07:48.261
Enrique.


01:07:50.482 --> 01:07:51.768
What happened to my dad?


01:07:56.946 --> 01:07:58.063
There was a fire.


01:07:59.865 --> 01:08:02.484
They say the hospital burned down.


01:08:04.953 --> 01:08:06.572
But it's just a rumor, right?


01:08:07.288 --> 01:08:08.998
They haven't seen anything.


01:08:12.586 --> 01:08:13.668
Enrique!


01:08:16.715 --> 01:08:18.002
Enrique!


01:08:32.271 --> 01:08:33.432
Enrique!


01:08:47.326 --> 01:08:48.363
Enrique!


01:09:35.539 --> 01:09:36.995
My God.


01:09:47.715 --> 01:09:49.424
Enrique, please!


01:09:49.677 --> 01:09:50.838
Stop!


01:09:53.054 --> 01:09:54.717
We don't know what happened.


01:09:54.890 --> 01:09:56.723
He might have gotten out.


01:09:56.891 --> 01:09:58.600
From the fifth floor?


01:09:59.143 --> 01:10:00.431
Hooked to an IV?


01:10:04.773 --> 01:10:06.061
What's left?


01:10:09.778 --> 01:10:12.613
Keep crawling through the sewers?


01:10:17.619 --> 01:10:19.531
There's nothing left, Marc.


01:10:31.591 --> 01:10:33.503
This was over a long time ago.


01:10:33.801 --> 01:10:36.090
We were just fooling ourselves.


01:10:38.472 --> 01:10:39.429
Maybe.


01:10:41.182 --> 01:10:43.596
But we need to keep
fooling ourselves.


01:10:45.937 --> 01:10:47.725
I have people waiting for rne.


01:10:50.149 --> 01:10:51.391
I don't.


01:10:54.112 --> 01:10:55.478
That's not true.


01:10:56.030 --> 01:10:57.772
I got this far thanks to you.


01:10:58.866 --> 01:11:01.657
Stop it.
I don't need your pity.


01:11:04.454 --> 01:11:06.447
- Let go of me!
- Listen to rne!


01:11:06.581 --> 01:11:08.449
- Listen to me!
- Let me go!


01:11:08.625 --> 01:11:09.616
Listen to rne.


01:11:10.252 --> 01:11:11.458
I still need you.


01:11:20.344 --> 01:11:21.632
You're almost there.


01:11:22.388 --> 01:11:24.632
You don't need me at all.


01:11:29.811 --> 01:11:31.143
What are you doing?


01:11:31.312 --> 01:11:34.148
Take them.
I have no use for them now.


01:11:37.944 --> 01:11:39.105
No, damn it.


01:11:39.820 --> 01:11:41.187
For your child.


01:11:41.822 --> 01:11:44.112
He'll need them much more than I do.


01:11:54.459 --> 01:11:56.121
What will you do?


01:11:57.504 --> 01:11:58.870
It doesn't matter.


01:12:01.340 --> 01:12:04.790
You took me all the way here
and that was the deal, right?


01:12:09.140 --> 01:12:10.723
Get out of here.


01:12:10.891 --> 01:12:12.553
Don't waste any more time.


01:12:23.445 --> 01:12:24.732
Get the hell out.


01:12:26.906 --> 01:12:28.819
I'm the bastard
who was going to fire you.


01:14:38.446 --> 01:14:39.562
Julia!


01:15:21.403 --> 01:15:22.313
Where are you?


01:15:23.154 --> 01:15:24.440
Where are you?


01:16:35.013 --> 01:16:39.807
<i>"Mom, we can'! Leave.
We're at the supermarket. Andrea. '</i>


01:17:09.253 --> 01:17:11.917
Didn't you get enough
the other day'?


01:17:13.173 --> 01:17:14.882
G0 back to your floor.


01:17:15.758 --> 01:17:17.171
I'm not from another floor.


01:17:17.385 --> 01:17:19.503
I came from outside,
from the sewers.


01:17:19.637 --> 01:17:22.473
I don't care if you dug
all the way here. Go away.


01:17:22.599 --> 01:17:23.887
We have no food for you.


01:17:24.058 --> 01:17:27.383
I don't want your food.
I'm looking for a girl.


01:17:27.979 --> 01:17:29.517
Don't come any closer.


01:17:30.773 --> 01:17:32.765
- Her name's Julia.
- I said stop.


01:17:33.275 --> 01:17:34.437
Freeze!


01:17:41.783 --> 01:17:43.196
I have a photograph.


01:17:56.214 --> 01:17:57.330
She's not here.


01:17:57.882 --> 01:18:00.501
I'd tell you to check upstairs,
but...


01:18:00.634 --> 01:18:02.844
they're less understanding
up there.


01:18:04.346 --> 01:18:05.634
Are you sure?


01:18:06.973 --> 01:18:08.090
She'd look different.


01:18:08.267 --> 01:18:10.135
She'd have longer hair.


01:18:10.644 --> 01:18:12.478
And a swollen belly.


01:18:13.730 --> 01:18:15.142
She's pregnant.


01:18:22.988 --> 01:18:25.448
There's a pregnant girl.
It could be her.


01:18:25.616 --> 01:18:26.276
Go check.


01:18:29.662 --> 01:18:32.031
They're checking inside
to see if she's here.


01:18:34.374 --> 01:18:35.206
Thank you.


01:18:49.806 --> 01:18:50.796
Hello?


01:19:13.118 --> 01:19:15.158
It's a trap! It's a trap!


01:19:59.621 --> 01:20:00.737
Julia!


01:20:02.956 --> 01:20:04.164
Julia!


01:20:08.670 --> 01:20:09.877
Julia!


01:20:20.098 --> 01:20:21.430
Julia!


01:20:22.975 --> 01:20:23.967
Marc?


01:20:25.185 --> 01:20:26.096
Marc!


01:20:26.271 --> 01:20:27.137
Julia!


01:20:28.981 --> 01:20:31.190
Andrea! Where's Julia?
Ls she with you?


01:20:31.358 --> 01:20:34.023
No, I'm sorry.
Have you heard from my mother?


01:20:35.780 --> 01:20:37.192
Quickly. We have to go.


01:20:37.364 --> 01:20:40.108
- What's happening?
- The people upstairs are hungry.


01:20:40.284 --> 01:20:41.150
Shit!


01:20:43.912 --> 01:20:45.199
Wait.


01:20:47.249 --> 01:20:51.166
I haven't seen her since that day
you called and the phones died.


01:20:51.335 --> 01:20:52.997
- Where did she go?
- To the doctor.


01:20:53.128 --> 01:20:55.088
- The doctor?
- Gynecologist.


01:20:56.757 --> 01:20:58.124
You're having a baby.


01:20:58.466 --> 01:20:59.377
Let's go!


01:21:05.724 --> 01:21:06.590
Come on.


01:21:12.396 --> 01:21:13.228
Huff!!-


01:21:18.819 --> 01:21:19.686
Andrea!


01:21:25.910 --> 01:21:26.866
Andrea!


01:21:33.834 --> 01:21:35.040
Get out of there!


01:21:52.016 --> 01:21:53.179
Go outside! Please!


01:21:53.518 --> 01:21:55.055
You have to try!


01:22:04.445 --> 01:22:05.436
Go outside!


01:22:12.370 --> 01:22:13.532
No!


01:22:44.150 --> 01:22:44.890
Enrique.


01:22:46.109 --> 01:22:48.022
You were right, you still need rne.


01:23:26.647 --> 01:23:27.854
Where's Julia?


01:23:29.733 --> 01:23:31.850
Via Layetana 54...


01:23:32.945 --> 01:23:34.061
I hope.


01:23:36.949 --> 01:23:38.110
Are you okay?


01:23:41.077 --> 01:23:42.365
You sure?


01:23:42.537 --> 01:23:43.903
I'm fine.


01:23:46.123 --> 01:23:47.991
It's nothing, don't worry.


01:23:49.168 --> 01:23:51.958
Let's go.
Before the building collapses.


01:24:08.644 --> 01:24:10.182
What the hell happened here?


01:24:16.986 --> 01:24:19.776
Someone broke through
to get to the sewers.


01:24:21.990 --> 01:24:24.030
Are we close to Julia?


01:24:25.369 --> 01:24:26.701
I don't know.


01:24:28.287 --> 01:24:29.245
Let's go UP-


01:24:40.633 --> 01:24:41.624
Hello?


01:24:44.011 --> 01:24:45.002
Hello?


01:24:59.942 --> 01:25:01.149
No fucking way.


01:25:04.446 --> 01:25:05.437
What is it?


01:25:06.823 --> 01:25:08.031
What's wrong?


01:25:08.743 --> 01:25:10.485
Layetana 54.


01:25:10.744 --> 01:25:12.531
That's where Julia is, right?


01:25:12.746 --> 01:25:14.113
We made it.


01:25:14.248 --> 01:25:15.956
The tunnel is blocked.


01:25:16.249 --> 01:25:18.367
How the fuck will we get over there?


01:25:21.045 --> 01:25:22.037
Where are you going?


01:25:22.213 --> 01:25:23.374
To find Julia.


01:26:05.670 --> 01:26:07.583
Julia... Julia!


01:26:07.755 --> 01:26:08.791
Julia!


01:26:10.675 --> 01:26:12.293
Julia! Julia!


01:26:29.318 --> 01:26:30.935
Julia! Over here!


01:26:31.111 --> 01:26:32.773
Julia! Julia!


01:26:55.299 --> 01:26:56.632
My love!


01:27:31.417 --> 01:27:33.080
I saw her, Enrique!


01:27:33.210 --> 01:27:34.372
I saw her.


01:27:48.015 --> 01:27:49.052
Enrique.


01:28:05.615 --> 01:28:06.481
Let me see.


01:28:23.800 --> 01:28:24.790
Okay.


01:28:25.801 --> 01:28:27.258
Don't worry.


01:28:27.720 --> 01:28:28.677
You'll be just fine.


01:28:29.222 --> 01:28:31.180
- We need to stop the bleeding.
- Marc.


01:28:33.600 --> 01:28:35.091
Press here.


01:28:35.435 --> 01:28:37.553
Press hard.
I'll go get something to...


01:28:37.730 --> 01:28:38.561
Marc.


01:28:39.397 --> 01:28:41.059
Stop.


01:28:41.816 --> 01:28:43.274
Forget it.


01:28:45.277 --> 01:28:46.393
No.


01:28:46.570 --> 01:28:50.238
No, don't do this to me.
I can stop it.


01:28:50.366 --> 01:28:51.232
Enough.


01:28:55.161 --> 01:28:56.278
There's no stopping this.


01:28:59.249 --> 01:29:03.041
Listen carefully, because
this is what you're going to do.


01:29:04.254 --> 01:29:06.463
You're going to stop whining,


01:29:07.423 --> 01:29:09.462
you're going to walk out that door


01:29:10.385 --> 01:29:13.551
and you're going to cross
that fucking street.


01:29:18.225 --> 01:29:19.513
I don't know if I can.


01:29:19.726 --> 01:29:20.968
Of course you can!


01:29:23.647 --> 01:29:25.606
You have people waiting
on the other side.


01:29:28.067 --> 01:29:30.151
This is not the end, Marc.


01:29:32.280 --> 01:29:33.271
Not for you.


01:29:36.950 --> 01:29:38.910
Hey. Stop that!


01:29:39.578 --> 01:29:42.163
It's nothing to get worked up over.


01:29:42.289 --> 01:29:46.458
It's better than having
a heart attack at home watching TV.


01:29:47.502 --> 01:29:48.960
At least,


01:29:50.505 --> 01:29:51.496
you're here


01:29:52.632 --> 01:29:53.794
to notice.


01:30:05.018 --> 01:30:09.017
Who would have thought
a year ago


01:30:10.774 --> 01:30:13.359
that something interesting
would finally happen to us.


01:34:21.800 --> 01:34:23.007
My love.


01:34:43.696 --> 01:34:44.732
Push!


01:34:45.072 --> 01:34:46.781
You're almost there. Push!


01:36:21.954 --> 01:36:22.989
Enric!


01:36:24.248 --> 01:36:25.239
Enric!


01:36:26.875 --> 01:36:27.536
Come up.

